`other loss` MEANS `another kind of loss (for example lost earnings or medical expenses)`
`interest yes` MEANS `yes: interest for the period from when the loss was first incurred until the assessment, at the 10-year Commonwealth bond rate the Reserve Bank published as applying on the first business day of the month and year given, unless the Regulations prescribe a rate (s 30)`
